Two hospital segments, two messages
•	Mid-size hospitals (50–200 beds): usually no in-house analytics team. Message: "See, for the first time, which insurers and procedures actually make you money."
•	Large hospitals and chains (200+ beds, multi-site): already have revenue cycle teams but limited payer-by-procedure profit views across sites. Message: "Compare every payer across every site, and walk into renewals with evidence."
