DeepClaim matches every claim to its bill, approval and settlement, separates patient-paid cuts from hospital-absorbed ones, and estimates profit per procedure for each payer.
STEP 3 · ACT
Bills are checked against agreed tariffs before they go out. Short settlements get appeal drafts. Renewals get an evidence pack. Your team reviews and sends.
STEP 4 · ASK
