 7. Visual theme
Concept: "Deep Ledger"
Calm precision with a sense of discovery. Think of a well-kept financial ledger and an editorial data report, not a typical hospital website. No stock photos of smiling doctors, stethoscopes or blue crosses. The hero is the claim itself: a bill being read line by line, with money colour-coded by where it went.
Why this works: hospital owners see dozens of 'healthcare software' sites that all look blue and clinical. A confident, finance-grade look signals that DeepClaim is about money and evidence, and the colour coding (paid / patient-paid / hospital-absorbed) teaches the core idea visually.
